      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعْبَلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A broad and long arrow-head:</i> (As, S,
O, K:) or an <i>iron</i> [<i>arrow-head</i>] <i>made broad,
and having no</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْر</span> [or <i>central ridge</i>]: (AHn,
TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَابِلُ</span>. (O, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِرْوَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
